<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Remove Curse</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Healer (guild level 18), Necromancer (guild level 24), Paladin (guild level 24)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast remove curse &lt;target&gt;
cast remove curse &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>When your prayer is answered, a curse is lifted from the target, and one 
curse each from all the things they carry and wear, at once. Cast on an 
object, it lifts a curse from the object and from what is inside it.
</p><p>Something cursed more than once needs another cast for each curse. You must 
be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Curse</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Disease</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>